# Everglow Gems Environment Variables Template

# MailServer Gmail SMTP Configuration (Server-Side Only)
# Note: SMTP_PASS must be a 16-character Google App Password (not your personal Gmail password)
SMTP_USER=your-business-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your-gmail-app-password

# Optional API URL for external services (if any)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=
